  "description": "\u201cTriangles which are on equal bases and in the same parallels are equal to one another.\u201d\n\u2014 Euclid's Elements, BOOK I \u2022 PROP. 38 (G.67)\n\n00:00 1 \u00b7 GIVEN: \u27e8 A B C \u27e9, \u27e8 D E F \u27e9 (/ B C / = / E F /, / A D / \u2225 / B F /)\n00:22 2 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: extend(/ A D /) \u2192 / G A /, / D H /\n00:29 3 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: parallel_line(B, / C A /) \u2192 / B G /, parallel_line(F, / D E /) \u2192 / F H /\n00:35 4 \u00b7 ASSERT: / B C / = / E F /, / B F / \u2225 / G H / \u2192 \u27e8 G B C A \u27e9 = \u27e8 D E F H \u27e9\n00:50 5 \u00b7 ASSERT: \u27e8 G A B \u27e9 = \u27e8 A B C \u27e9, \u27e8 D E F \u27e9 = \u27e8 D H F \u27e9\n01:04 6 \u00b7 \u2234: \u27e8 A B C \u27e9 = \u27e8 D E F \u27e9\n\nGEOMETOR \u2022 G.67 \u2022 v2",
